te> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.36</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">as a work of supererogation</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mus.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.108K.</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς ἐκ τοῦ π. εἰς εὐπρέπειαν ἠσκημένοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Am.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">33</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοσοῦτον ὑμῖν περίεστι τοῦ πρὸς ἐμὲ μίσους</span> you <b class=\"lex-tr\">have</b> such <b class=\"lex-tr\">an excess</b> of hatred against me, Ps.Philipp. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοσοῦτον αὐτῷ περιῆν</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ὕβρεως</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.17</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.46</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ael.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">NA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.34</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22(19).6</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">τοσοῦτον περίεστιν</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ὕβρεως</span>( <span class=\"gk\">, ὥστε τοὺς ἠδικημένους πρὸς συκοφαντοῦσιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">55.29</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be left over and above, to be the net result</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ὑμῖν περίεστιν ἐκ τού